## Routing

The website uses Vue Router for routing. Routes are defined in `src/router/index.js`.

## State Management

The website uses Vuex for state management. The store is located in `src/store/index.js`.

## API Integration

API calls are made using Axios. The API service is located in `src/services/api.js`.

